      <a href="#expertise">Expertise</a>
      <a href="#bring">What I Bring</a>
      <a href="#education">Education</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
  <svg class="hero-doodle doodle-1" viewBox="0 0 60 60" style="color:var(--rose-deep);"><use href="#flower-icon"/></svg>
  <svg class="hero-doodle doodle-2" viewBox="0 0 60 60" style="color:var(--periwinkle-deep);"><use href="#flower-icon"/></svg>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="hero-flex">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="dot"></span> Communications &amp; Digital Strategy</div>
        <h1>Hadiqa Shahid</h1>
        <p class="sub">I'm a communications strategist and copywriter who turns research, data, and policy into messaging people actually stop for — presidential campaign copy, human rights advocacy, fashion brand storytelling. I care as much about the strategy behind a campaign as the sentence that sells it. Fueled by good coffee and an ongoing to-be-read pile. ☕</p>
        <div class="hero-contact">
          <a href="mailto:hs3392@nyu.edu">✉ hs3392@nyu.edu</a>
          <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/hadiqashahid/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">in/hadiqashahid</a>
          <span>◍ New York, NY</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-photo-wrap">
        <img class="hero-photo" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Hadiqa Shahid">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<div class="ticker-shell">
  <div class="ticker-label">Career metrics</div>
  <div class="ticker-track" id="tickerTrack"></div>
</div>

<main>
  <section class="section" id="experience">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="section-num">01</span>
        <h2>Experience</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline" id="timeline">

        <div class="entry">
